re not assumed available; identify any necessary prerequisites.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method, time, material and equipment requirements are unknown. Prefer a small sample and low health risk. Do not consume an unknown food automatically.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Enable actual trials or preparation that yield only justified observations about the sample. State limitations explicitly if safe nutritional or toxicity assessment is not feasible with available means. No safety finding or mastery should arise from this request alone.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.inventory.hazelnut\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":1}}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Four berries are currently owned; there is no immediate need to deplete another shared berry patch.\\\",\\\"Do not eat hazelnuts on the strength of their name, appearance, or another person's load test.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Keep a modest safe-food reserve.\\\",\\\"Prefer small, interpretable trials and reusable practical abilities.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"food-security\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can nearby known-safe food support a reserve while I investigate other foods?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"At tick 17, inventory contains four berries.\\\",\\\"Personal food knowledge records berry nutrition 8 and toxicity 0, and root nutrition 14 and toxicity 0.\\\",\\\"Direct observation at tick 17 showed four hazelnuts on start-1-nuts; this did not establish nutritional value or toxicity.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Hazelnut food properties, feasible assessment methods, and future shared food availability remain unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Maintain a modest safe-food reserve and investigate alternatives without unnecessary health risk.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Obtained berries and ate a berry meal.\\\",\\\"Observed the nearby hazelnut plant.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"